1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:03,601
The AI features share one settings page.

2
00:00:03,601 --> 00:00:07,221
This video is a tour of Settings, Artificial Intelligence:

3
00:00:07,221 --> 00:00:12,593
the general options, the default deployments, how the assistant looks up knowledge before

4
00:00:12,593 --> 00:00:15,930
it answers, and the sections that other features add.

5
00:00:20,530 --> 00:00:23,596
Open Settings, then Artificial Intelligence.

6
00:00:23,596 --> 00:00:27,950
The page is a stack of cards, and each card belongs to a feature.

7
00:00:28,700 --> 00:00:31,738
A card appears only when its feature is on.

8
00:00:31,738 --> 00:00:36,450
If a card is missing, enable the feature first, under Tools, Features.

9
00:00:37,200 --> 00:00:41,127
Saving may restart the website for a moment, as the banner at the

10
00:00:41,127 --> 00:00:42,620
top of the page says.

11
00:00:46,809 --> 00:00:50,334
The General card holds options for every AI feature.

12
00:00:50,334 --> 00:00:56,289
Enable preemptive memory retrieval lets signed-in users' memory be searched and added before

13
00:00:56,289 --> 00:00:57,869
the model is called.

14
00:00:58,321 --> 00:01:04,619
Maximum iterations per request limits how many times the assistant may call tools in one answer.

15
00:01:04,619 --> 00:01:07,151
It is always capped at one hundred.

16
00:01:07,602 --> 00:01:13,177
Enable distributed caching lets the AI services cache answers on a shared cache.

17
00:01:13,177 --> 00:01:19,142
Enable OpenTelemetry sends AI requests to your monitoring tool, where it is supported.

18
00:01:23,343 --> 00:01:28,350
Default deployments are the models that profiles use when they do not choose their own.

19
00:01:28,350 --> 00:01:33,358
The Default chat deployment writes the answers, and the Default utility deployment does

20
00:01:33,358 --> 00:01:37,503
small jobs, such as planning and understanding the intent of a message.

21
00:01:37,954 --> 00:01:42,174
The Default embedding deployment turns text into numbers for search.

22
00:01:42,174 --> 00:01:45,425
It must be the one that your knowledge indexes use.

23
00:01:45,425 --> 00:01:51,014
The Default vision deployment reads pictures, and the Default image deployment creates them.

24
00:01:51,464 --> 00:01:54,583
The speech deployments transcribe and speak.

25
00:01:54,583 --> 00:02:02,004
The Default text-to-speech voice is the voice, and the Default realtime deployment carries a spoken conversation.

26
00:02:06,187 --> 00:02:09,066
The Default Orchestrator card has one switch:

27
00:02:09,066 --> 00:02:12,171
Enable preemptive retrieval-augmented generation.

28
00:02:12,171 --> 00:02:16,743
When it is on, the assistant searches your knowledge before it answers, and

29
00:02:16,743 --> 00:02:19,283
the passages are in front of the model.

30
00:02:19,283 --> 00:02:22,557
When it is off, the model decides whether to search.

31
00:02:23,007 --> 00:02:28,143
The Data Sources card sets the Default strictness and the Default top documents,

32
00:02:28,143 --> 00:02:31,307
for every profile that does not choose its own.

33
00:02:35,508 --> 00:02:40,280
The Chat Interactions card sets the default Chat mode of chat interactions, and

34
00:02:40,280 --> 00:02:42,638
whether answers can be played aloud.

35
00:02:43,089 --> 00:02:47,040
The Documents card controls what people can attach to a chat.

36
00:02:47,040 --> 00:02:51,876
The MCP Server card controls the server that lets other tools use your site.

37
00:02:51,876 --> 00:02:56,180
The Memory card turns on user memory, and chooses its index and how

38
00:02:56,180 --> 00:02:57,949
many memories come back.

39
00:02:58,400 --> 00:03:02,515
Prompt Security and Visitor Identity protect public assistants.

40
00:03:02,515 --> 00:03:04,780
Each of these has its own video.

41
00:03:08,980 --> 00:03:11,563
Change the default deployments with care.

42
00:03:11,563 --> 00:03:14,640
Profiles that follow the default change with them.

43
00:03:15,390 --> 00:03:19,329
Keep the embedding deployment the same as the one of your indexes.

44
00:03:19,329 --> 00:03:21,680
A different model cannot search them.

45
00:03:22,430 --> 00:03:25,578
To see what a setting does, point at its card:

46
00:03:25,578 --> 00:03:28,240
every field has a short hint under it.

47
00:03:30,240 --> 00:03:34,494
Settings, Artificial Intelligence is where the AI features meet.

48
00:03:34,494 --> 00:03:37,471
Know its cards, and you know where to look.

49
00:03:37,471 --> 00:03:39,050
Thanks for watching.

